  "description": "O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this excellent ground floor apartment ideally postioned on Upper Newcastle Road, just a short stroll to Galway Univeristy. \r\n\r\nNo.2 Martello Court is a ground floor apartment in a small residential complex. The property offers well proportioned living accommodation with approximately 71.6 sq.m throughout. \r\n\r\nAccessible via a security door communal area, the apartment accommodation consists of two large bedrooms, both suitable for double bedrooms & availing of fitted wardrobes, a main bathroom, and a large open-plan area comprising dining, living & kitchen spaces. \r\n\r\nExternally, Martello Court offers landscaped communal space with communal gardens at the rear, residential parking & outdoor lockers. \r\n\r\nThe location of Martello Court is second to none. Privately positioned with tree-lined frontage on Upper Newcastle Road, the complex is within walking distance of Galway university, UCHG, City Centre & Dangan Sportsgrounds. All amenities & services are within easy reach. \r\n\r\nNo.2 Martello Court will be a perfect property for a variety of purchasers, whether for owner occupancy or investment, due to the excellent accommodation space, good quality condition & ideal location.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended & guaranteed not to dissapoint. \r\n\r\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \r\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \r\n\r\nFor Further details please contact O’Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \r\nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\r\n\r\nNOTE:  These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer.  They are for information only and give a general idea of the property.  They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\r\n\r\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only.  The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout.  All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\r\n\r\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy.  Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\r\n\r\nNo person in the employment of O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property.",
